EDUCATIONAL-USE NOTICE

This software is an intentionally vulnerable laboratory for teaching defensive
and offensive security. It contains deliberate security flaws. Run it only on
your own machine, bound to 127.0.0.1. All names, companies, institutions and
records in it are fictional. Using the techniques it teaches against systems
you are not authorized to test may be a crime.

